cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mdplib: A Python library with a C++ core for solving infinite-horizon Markov Decision Processes"
abstract: >-
  mdplib is an open-source Python library for solving discounted,
  infinite-horizon Markov Decision Processes. It implements Value Iteration
  (Jacobi and Gauss-Seidel variants), Policy Iteration, Q-Learning and SARSA,
  with a numerical core written in C++ and exposed to Python through pybind11.
